/p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>GEARBOX SIDE RUBBER MOUNT</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.7 - 3.4</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Tighten the gearbox left  rigid mount -\n flexible block fastrening screw to the specified torque</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>POWER UNIT GEAR BOX END RIGID MOUNT</p></td><td><p>M10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.2 ÷ 5.1</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Remove the hydraulic jack from under the\nengine.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a></p><p>Remove the car from the hoist .</p>"],[264,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238220\">4450B02</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <strong>- 7055B90 Left front WHEEL ARCH\nLINER - R.R.</strong>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Position a hydraulic jack under the engine.</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and (1b), then remove the flexible mounting\nfor the gearbox side support (1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014358.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]